def SRC := /opt/data/workspace/hermes-context/; def DST := /workspace/hermes-context/
def mirror_class A9: contents + structure + symlinks only; metadata/timestamps/hardlinks excluded
A2: sync never writes to SRC; one-way host -> workspace
A5/A7: forall sync path (rsync primary ∨ cp -a fallback) -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive; verify exit nonzero on mismatch
A6/A16: --dry-run -> zero writes of any kind; DST nonexistent-if-absent preserved; log dir always outside DST (A8)
A11/A13: stage -> content-verify -> touch DST; applies to both sync paths
A12/A18/A22: refuse SRC==DST, ancestor/descendant, degenerate paths ('', '.', '/'), DST-level symlinks
A14/A15/A23: concrete-owned-path guard, boundary-aware; stage order = validate-pure-string-parent -> mktemp -d -> re-validate
A17/A23: env override is contract; unset->default, set-empty->refuse
A10/A21: exotic filenames + adversarial env combos beyond guard -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS, not FAIL
A19/A24: no ownership scope invented beyond OS; refusal law closed
open: []
